@startuml
!include includes/style.puml
allow_mixing

title home-ai · 模块依赖
caption AI 能力模块化单体：agent 只通过 tools 访问业务能力；platform 不依赖业务模块。

package "home-ai（FastAPI）" as AIPkg {
  package "业务模块" {
    component "agent\npi-agent 入口\n会话 · 意图 · 路由\n（只经 tools 访问业务）" as Agent <<agent>>
    component "tools\n工具注册表\n唯一桥：agent → 业务能力" as Tools <<agent>>
    component "intake\n上传 · 识别 · 草稿" as Intake <<service>>
    component "knowledge\n摄取 · 检索 · 引用" as Knowledge <<readonly>>
  }

  component "platform\nllm · storage · jobs\n（不依赖业务模块）" as Platform <<infra>>
  component "core_client\nhome-core API 客户端" as CoreClient <<infra>>
}

component "home-core API" as CoreAPI <<service>>

Agent --> Tools : 唯一入口
Tools --> Intake : public service
Tools --> Knowledge : public service
Tools --> CoreClient : 资源 / 任务
Intake --> Platform : llm / storage / jobs
Knowledge --> Platform : llm / storage / jobs
Agent --> Platform : llm / jobs
Intake --> CoreClient : 读 / 提交
Knowledge --> CoreClient : 只读投影
CoreClient --> CoreAPI : HTTP

note bottom of AIPkg
  **模块纪律**
  · agent 不直接 import intake / knowledge；只能通过 tools
  · 业务模块各自有 contracts + services + tests；不共享 ORM
  · platform 只提供 llm/storage/jobs，不依赖业务模块
  · 未来编排（LangGraph/DSH）作为新模块加入，不改 tools / 业务模块
end note

@enduml
